1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:05,234
Writing, task two. E-mail number 3: A weekend trip.

2
00:00:05,933 --> 00:00:15,494
You want to invite a friend on a trip. Write him an e-mail. Write at least thirty-five words. Write one sentence for each picture.

3
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:25,445
Hi Martin,

4
00:00:25,733 --> 00:00:27,327
do you want to come on a trip with us?

5
00:00:27,633 --> 00:00:29,403
We're going to Karlštejn Castle.

6
00:00:29,700 --> 00:00:31,843
We'll leave on Saturday morning at eight.

7
00:00:32,133 --> 00:00:35,113
We'll take the train from Prague, it's only 40 minutes.

8
00:00:35,400 --> 00:00:38,903
We'll have a tour of the castle and then go for a walk in the forest.

9
00:00:39,200 --> 00:00:42,020
Bring comfortable shoes and something to eat.

10
00:00:42,333 --> 00:00:44,149
Let me know if you're coming.

11
00:00:44,433 --> 00:00:51,464
This e-mail has 56 words. There is one sentence for each picture. Don't forget the greeting at the beginning and the end.

12
00:00:52,167 --> 00:01:01,177
Write your own e-mail on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website, the link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.
